# Regression fixture for issue #56, IC-seed call site. Same shape as
# ic_derived.net — a species initial condition set by a DERIVED
# (ConstantExpression) parameter, with the fitted primary R0 reaching the state
# ONLY through that IC — but the derived expression now uses a COMPOUND
# condition. At sel = 5 the true branch is live, so ∂R(0)/∂R0 is 1, exactly as
# in ic_derived.net. Before the fix _derived_expr_partials_numeric could not
# parse the compound condition, returned {}, and the seed was silently left at
# 0 while the forward trajectory stayed correct.
begin parameters
    1 R0     100.0   # Constant
    2 kf     0.5     # Constant
    3 sel    5.0     # Constant
    4 Rtot   if((sel>=1)&&(sel<10), R0, 0.5*R0)   # ConstantExpression
end parameters
begin species
    1 R() Rtot
    2 P() 0.0
end species
begin reactions
    1 1 2 kf   #_R_decay
end reactions
begin groups
    1 R_tot 1
    2 P_tot 2
end groups
